<title>UK: Saudi livestock ship has fire in feed storage hold.</title>
<headline>Saudi livestock ship has fire in feed storage hold.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Saudi Arabian-flag livestock carrier Mawashi Tabuk sustained no significant damage after a fire in its animal feed storage hold on March 12, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said.</p>
<p>The fire was brought under control and the 18,328 dwt vessel returned to Adelaide, Australia, to discharge its cargo.</p>
<p>The Mawashi Tabuk initially left Adelaide on March 10 for New Zealand.</p>
</text>
